## Phase 8 — Finalize (gates, docs, version)

**Tasks:**
1. Run the full gate set and make everything green with **no warnings**:
   `npm run build`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm run format:check`, `npm test`
   (and `npm run check-types-pack` if the tarball shape could be affected — it should not be).
   Fix anything that fails, even if pre-existing. Confirm **no `.tmp` files** remain anywhere
   (`git status` clean of `*.tmp`).
2. Refresh the README **Coverage** section: run `npm run test:coverage`, update the
   "As of v0.3.2 … 512 tests … 98.65%/95.36%/100%/100%" stamp to the new version and the
   freshly-derived test count and coverage figures.
3. Promote the `CHANGELOG.md` `[Unreleased]` section to a dated version heading and bump
   `package.json#version` to **0.3.3** (patch — all changes are backward-compatible bug/spec
   fixes and tooling; escalate to **0.4.0** only if the sandboxed judges deem the robots-`none`
   or two-instance change breaking). Edit `package.json` directly — **do not** run `npm version`
   (it creates a git tag; integration is external). Re-run all gates once more; end 100% green.

